---
import MarketingLayout from "../../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
---

<MarketingLayout canonicalPath="/ru/features" locale="ru" title="Возможности" description="Возможности VATranscribe для скачивания медиа, транскрибации, SaaS security и billing-ready workflows.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Возможности</span>
      <h1 class="h1">Полноценная media workflow поверхность, а не набор утилит.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Публичный marketing layer объясняет продукт, а dashboard обрабатывает authenticated jobs,
        files, transcripts, quotas и account state.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Downloader</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">MP3 и MP4 workflows</h2><p class="muted">Скачивание совместимых audio/video outputs со статусами, progress и logs.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Transcription</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">Основа transcript pipeline</h2><p class="muted">Связка media assets с transcription jobs, transcript history и export artifacts.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Security</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">Security и privacy baseline</h2><p class="muted">Refresh token rotation, rate limits, backend password policy, consents и audit logs.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Ownership</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">User-owned files</h2><p class="muted">Jobs, media assets, transcripts и exports привязаны к authenticated ownership.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Billing</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">Billing-ready model</h2><p class="muted">Plans, quotas, subscriptions и usage history подготовлены к payment integration.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="badge badge-accent">Marketing</span><h2 class="h3" style="margin-top: 16px;">SEO-ready public layer</h2><p class="muted">Astro marketing pages отделены от authenticated SaaS dashboard.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>